# Website Context Mode

- Read the root `AGENTS.md` first on every task.
- Treat `AGENTS.md` as the single working rule source for Codex / Cursor in this repo.
- Read only the minimum extra Website docs needed for the current task.
- Do not scan the whole docs tree just to understand context.
- Expand the reading set only when the task genuinely requires it.
- Modify only the files required by the task.
- Do not touch `legacy/` unless the task explicitly authorizes migration or verification work.
- Use existing implementations before introducing new ones.
- Do not self-approve visual gates that require human review.
- Keep changes small, direct, and verifiable.
